  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "This rank two Gu has outer form like a lizard with many colors. The most commonly seen colors are dark green, sky blue, and milky white. They are huge, like buses. The lizard has two eyes that act as windows, and the two sides of the body also have windows. Sprawled on the ground, the open mouth reveals the door. When the tribe relocates, it gets up and moves on four strong limbs.",
        "chapters": [
          439
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is a rank two Gu. Its outer shape is a lizard; the common colors are dark green, sky blue, and milky white. It is about the size of a bus, with the two eyes and the body sides serving as windows, and the open mouth as the door.",
        "chapters": [
          439
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Inside is a long passage with rooms on both sides and a toilet at the end for temporary waste. When the tribe moves, the lizard stands and walks on four limbs. When waste builds up, it lifts its tail and empties that store. A family living in one needs at least one Gu Master.",
        "chapters": [
          439
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It again has eyes as windows and mouth as the door, and it can also move by its own will. Lizard house and large lizard house are among the simplified Gu house forms made from one Gu, with might lower than houses assembled from many Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          568
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "simplified-gu-house",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_house"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
